 > **Build a responsive PocketSmart AI web application where a user can enter income and expenses, view a personalized financial dashboard, create a budget and savings goal, and receive AI-generated recommendations based on their spending patterns.**

 This gives the project a clear **Brainstorming → Requirements → UI/UX → Development → AI Integration → Testing → Deployment** path.
